bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Ahead of me, I find her waiting there, holding another one of the animals.
text Once I arrive, she thanks the animal before putting it back down on the ground.
text The two animals rejoin and climb up a little hill as a couple.
text At its summit is one more of the things.
text The three run side-by-side, as if a family.
text I watch them as they run off, practically in disbelief.
text ..."Were you afraid?"
text She places a hand on my head.
text I nod yes.
text ..."Me too."
text ..."But I'm so glad."
text ..."We need to thank those children."
text I nod yes again.
text So these kinds of things really do happen.
text ..."Isn't it mysterious?"
text It really is.
text ..."Something about them smelled gentle."
text Her profile looks kind as she says the words.
music ~
